      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">The older homes along Topsail Road and Paradise Road still heat with oil, and a tank tag doesn't wait for spring. We replace, remove and upgrade oil tanks across Paradise with a free written estimate before any work starts.</p>
