<section style="padding:96px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Paradise, NL has grown faster than almost any town on the Avalon, and most of that growth went up on electric heat. The older core along Topsail Road, Paradise Road and St. Thomas Line is a different story. Plenty of those homes still run on oil, and those are the tanks we get called about. Harbour Tank Co handles <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-st-johns/">oil tank replacement</a>, <a href="/oil-tank-removal-st-johns/">tank removal</a> and <a href="/fibreglass-oil-tank-upgrade-st-johns/">fibreglass upgrades</a> for Paradise homeowners, licensed and insured, with a free written estimate first.</p><p>A lot of our Paradise calls come from young families who just bought an older home and found out at closing that the tank tag is expired or nearly there. Others come from the driveway in the middle of a St. John's winter, when the delivery driver reads the tag and pulls away with a full truck. Either way, call (709) 800-3117 and we'll tell you straight what the tank needs and what it'll cost.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Paradise</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Paradise Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Replacement in Paradise</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">New steel or fibreglass tanks installed, tagged and registered at older homes across Paradise, from the Topsail Road core out to St. Thomas Line. The old tank leaves on our truck the same visit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Removal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Switched to a heat pump and still have a rusty tank beside the house? We drain it, disconnect the lines and haul it away, so it's out of your yard and off your insurance paperwork.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Fibreglass Oil Tank Upgrade</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Fibreglass doesn't rust from the inside the way steel does, and it carries a longer tag. If you're settling into Paradise for the long haul, it's often the smarter buy.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Expired Tag and Leaking Tank Emergencies</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Refused delivery with a cold house, or oil on the ground? Our 24/7 emergency line gets a crew moving toward Paradise fast. Call (709) 800-3117 any hour.</p>
      </div>
</div>
